sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as UI thread
    participant WL as write_draw_list
    participant SB as snapshot_buffer
    participant RT as Render thread

    UI->>WL: clear + push commands
    UI->>WL: sort_by_texture()
    UI->>SB: try_publish(damage, frame_index)
    Note over SB: atomic read_index swap — O(1), no copy

    RT->>SB: acquire() → const immutable_frame_snapshot&
    RT->>RT: Vulkan record/submit
    RT->>SB: release(frame_index)
    Note over SB: in_flight counter decremented
